## About the site

West of Mauritius is an editorial guide to the west coast of Mauritius, published by Olivier, its founder and editor. Contact: [hello@westofmauritius.mu](mailto:hello@westofmauritius.mu).

## Information, not advice

We take care to keep information accurate and list our sources, but opening hours, prices, rules and other details change. Check with the business or authority concerned before you rely on them. Our articles about buying property, residency and taxes are general information, not legal, tax or financial advice; speak to a qualified professional, such as a notary, before you decide.

## Featured places and partner links

Places marked "Featured" may be paid placements. Some links to bookings or partners are affiliate links: we may earn a commission if you book, at no extra cost to you. They are marked as partner links. Payment never buys a review or changes what we write.

## Property enquiries

When you send a property enquiry, we pass your details, with your consent, to developers and estate agents. We are not a party to any agreement you make with them and are not responsible for their offers or services.

## Community

Members of our WhatsApp group agree to treat others with respect. We may remove anyone who posts spam, advertising without permission, or abuse.

## Content and use

The texts and design of this site are protected by copyright. Photos belong to their photographers and are used under the licences shown on our [photo credits](/en/credits) page. You may share links freely; please ask before reusing our texts.

## Liability

To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for decisions made on the basis of information on this site or on sites we link to.

## Applicable law

These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Mauritius.
